 "about": "Art-01 (ADR-0043), FAB-01 (ADR-0051): what Build/Python/prepare_fab_assets.py migrates from the Fab staging into Content/Fab, and the swaps it applies in the game. Kept paths are under /Game/Fab/<Pack> in the staging; a pack still at the staging's root (staged_at) is moved there first. texture_source_max: the migrated textures' sources are downsized to it (hero_texture_source_max: a hero mesh's own textures to more). DRONE-01 (ADR-0054): only the Legacy drone's static mesh (and its two materials and four textures) of AdvancedCompanionDroneSystem. CHAR-01 (ADR-0055): three Paragon characters (ParagonWraith -> the ExoFrame, ParagonRiktor -> the Iron Pilgrim, ParagonSevarog -> the Echo-Stalker): each its skeletal mesh (its skeleton, physics, materials and textures come with it) and the few animations its animation assets use; a character's own textures to texture_source_max_by_folder, its material layers' tiles to texture_source_max; lean (Riktor, Sevarog: never moved in the staging) or prepare kept (Wraith): only what the kept assets need to run is prepared and copied (hard references only), hidden_slots (Wraith's rifle, Riktor's long hook chain that stands out straight in his idle) change only the staging copy before.",
